WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:02.659
Speaker 1: All right, let's go through the
list.

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:07.310
The rapidly growing it's almost impossible
to keep up with the growing list of vaccine

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:14.990
requirements and mandates now coming forward
from educational institutions, employers,

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.210
states, with regard to state workers.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:25.250
All happening very quickly in the aftermath
of the Pfizer covid vaccine receiving full

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:31.830
FDA approval, something sort of a watershed
moment that was waited, awaited by many on

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:37.780
both the pro and anti vaccine sides, the anti
back sides, either hoping it wouldn't happen

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.610
or saying if it happens, then I will get vaccinated.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:42.610
Let's see if they do.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:47.600
And of course, those of us on the pro vaccine
side waiting for what was obviously going

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.260
to happen with the hope that it will help
get us out of the pandemic.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:56.859
Now, we've already talked about the Pentagon
announcing all one point three million U.S.

00:00:56.859 --> 00:00:58.920
service members will be required to be vaccinated.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.219
We don't know the exact timeline yet.

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:05.269
Presumably it will be a couple of months,
but the military will be vaccinating all active

00:01:05.269 --> 00:01:07.020
duty service members.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.259
We've previously also talked about New York
City Bill de Blasio, the mayor in New York

00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:19.350
City, enacting mandates for indoor dining
and a ton of other leisure and entertainment

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.750
activities in the state of New York over the
weekend.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.930
And the city of New York, rather, over the
weekend.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:28.330
There was a very, very extreme anti vaccine
protest.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.270
Maybe we'll look at some clips of that tomorrow.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.740
It's a little difficult to watch, quite frankly.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.939
The cringe is high and the delusions are even
higher.

00:01:36.939 --> 00:01:40.440
But let's look at some of the other requirements
that are now being put in place.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:46.350
And speaking of New York, the New York City
Public Schools organization has issued a full

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.429
covid vaccine mandate for all staff.

00:01:49.429 --> 00:01:52.250
You want to work at New York City schools,
public schools?

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.820
Do you want to teach at New York City public
schools?

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.969
You will have to be vaccinated.

00:01:56.969 --> 00:02:00.229
That'll take effect September 27th.

00:02:00.229 --> 00:02:07.649
And all education employees will be required
to upload proof of at least the first dose

00:02:07.649 --> 00:02:11.790
to an online portal going from New York to
Texas.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:18.420
Texas Instruments, a for profit company in
Texas, will require all U.S. based employees

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.810
to get the covid-19 vaccine.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:23.090
They are based in Dallas.

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:28.600
It is a it's really a semiconductor company,
although I know Texas Instruments for those

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:34.560
graphing calculators that were so much fun
in high school math, they will be required.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.410
Both employees and contractors will be required
to be vaccinated by October 29th.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.580
Otherwise they will lose their jobs.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:47.780
Disney has reached a deal with the Service
Trades Council Union to require all of its

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:54.580
unionized employees working at Walt Disney
World in Florida to be fully vaccinated by

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.300
October 22nd of twenty twenty one.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:01.080
Fully vaccinated, presumably meaning both
doses, meaning at the latest they will have

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:05.860
to get that first dose in that in the second
half of September.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:12.170
Remember that last month Disney mandated all
of its salary and nonunion hourly employees

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.850
get vaccinated by the end of September.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:19.940
And now a deal for all of the union employees
to be vaccinated as well.

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:25.570
Anecdotally in Seattle, there are now more
than one hundred and thirty different bars

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:29.470
and restaurants requiring vaccine proof.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:35.710
And that list is growing relatively quickly,
expected to be even faster now with full vaccine

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.160
approval.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:42.190
And then we also have a bunch of different
stories out of New Jersey.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:48.260
New Jersey is going to require covid vaccination
for teachers and for state workers.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.240
The governor there is Phil Murphy, a Democrat.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:56.520
He announced the mandate during a news conference,
I believe yesterday.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:04:02.780
Pre-K through 12th grade teachers and staff
and state employees must be fully vaccinated

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:08.940
by October 18th, or they will have to get
tested once or twice a week.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:15.590
Now, the testing or vaccine, I'm not really
big on it, but there are places that are doing

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.590
it.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:20.210
It's sort of a softer vaccine requirement
to say if you're not, you will have to be

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:25.900
tested once or twice a week and then for something
completely different coming, just showing

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:31.720
the breadth of places we are seeing these
requirements Navajo Nation has now issued.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:36.750
A vaccine mandate for tribal workers, this
is happening.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:41.040
The question now is, what are the resisters
going to do?

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:44.350
Some of them are just going to go and get
vaccinated, without question.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:50.780
But are there some folks that will actually
quit a job over a vaccine requirement?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.750
Are they more likely to fake their vaccination
results?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:54.750
Will they?

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:59.660
Are we going to see lawsuits come forward
saying that this is a violation of who knows

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.250
what, but just some kind of legal attempt
to resist?

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.210
This is going to become a huge issue.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:09.490
Now, the easiest thing from the standpoint
of just like, do I go and find a fake vaccine

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:10.490
card?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.590
Do I hire a lawyer and file a lawsuit or whatever
the case may be?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:17.440
The easiest thing continues to be just go
and get vaccinated.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:22.750
It's even easier to actually get vaccinated
than to fake a vaccine card.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.070
It's legal as opposed to faking a vaccine
card.

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:32.860
And it provides you with some protection,
particularly against serious covid hospitalization

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:33.860
or death.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:37.530
So it's much more useful than a fake vaccine
card.

